      "text": "Strumento da dare a un Pokémon.\nSe chi ce l’ha è il primo della squadra, aiuta\nad allontanare i Pokémon selvatici.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. It helps keep\nwild Pokémon away if the holder is the head of\nthe party.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "１番　前の　ポケモンに\n持たせると　野生ポケモンが\nでて　きにくくなる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "让排在最前面的宝可梦携带后，\n野生宝可梦就会不容易出现。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si lo lleva el primer Pokémon del equipo, se reduce la\nprobabilidad de que se acerquen Pokémon salvajes.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
